This product includes software developed elsewhere:

- SIP registration, digest authentication and call handling in core/src/main/java/kioskvoip/sip/
  are adapted from meiser79/kiosk-satellite-sip-phone, commit d4cec06
  (https://github.com/meiser79/kiosk-satellite-sip-phone, Apache License 2.0).
- G722.java is a Java port of the SpanDSP G.722 codec by Steve Underwood (public domain), taken
  from Asterisk (https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk, codecs/g722/).
- The build tools in tools/, the plugin interfaces in sdk/ and the release workflow in
  .github/workflows/ come from or follow the Kiosk Satellite "Hello World" plugin template
